      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "free_college_through_military_service",
      "label": "Free College Through Military Service",
      "description": "A real-world concept and policy in some countries (notably the United States) where enlisting in the military provides educational benefits, such as tuition coverage or scholarships, often through programs like the GI Bill. This is a real-world policy that the meme references to imply that joining the military is a pathway to obtaining free college education.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
