      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Propaganda",
      "description": "The meme uses the visual of soldiers marching and the text 'we're getting ready to go march for free college' to promote the idea that enlisting in the military is a necessary or recommended path to obtain free college education. This is a form of propaganda as it attempts to influence public opinion or behavior by associating military service with a desirable outcome (free college), potentially encouraging enlistment under the guise of educational opportunity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1d7d1393"
